**/.git
**/.gitignore
# Never let host node_modules into any build context. Both forms are listed on
# purpose: a bare `node_modules` also covers the context root, and the `**/`
# form covers nested packages (e.g. packages/mfe-sdk/node_modules).
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.test
**/.env.docker
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/.DS_Store
**/tmp
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/agent-transcripts
**/.cursor
**/.claude
**/plans
docs/brainstorm
backend/docs
**/*.log
**/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
